    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>execute() always runs the same steps:
1. gatherContext   2. buildTask
3. orchestrator.run(task)
4. createParser().parse(reply)  (retry up to 2× if invalid)
5. validate   6. return WorkflowOutcome
Subclasses only fill in steps 2, 4 (and optionally 1, 5).
fontsize=12</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes></additional_attributes>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>80</x>
      <y>0</y>
      <w>310</w>
      <h>160</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Colour = pattern
Yellow: Template Method · Purple: Strategy
Cyan: Adapter
Tools wrap deterministic code (see CD4):
VenueSearchTool → VenueCatalog
BudgetCalculatorTool → BudgetTracker
ConflictCheckTool → ConflictDetector
CateringCalculatorTool → CateringCalculator
SpeakerAvailabilityTool → Speaker.isAvailable()
AttendeeQueryTool → EventRepository
fontsize=12</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes></additional_attributes>
